          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_these_systems_powerful_but_they",
          "text": "These systems are powerful, but they behave very differently from living systems, which learn, make associations, and adapt using sparse data, efficient energy use, and few training iterations.",
