          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_biology_solves_interplay_mechanisms",
          "text": "Biology solves this with an interplay of mechanisms — metaplasticity that tunes how much synapses change, homeostasis that regulates the system around a set point, inhibition, and resets that enable forgetting.",
